At the hands of highly skilled masters who are committed to using true, local JianYang clay, we can get a glimpse into the past and experience what it must have been like to sip the frothy white tea from these immaculate vessels.
It would not be incorrect to say that to gaze into a JianZhan teacup is to gaze into the cosmos itself, complete with all of its splendor, beauty, and mystery.
