“Negative ions” decompose water molecules in the air through high-voltage electrodes, and combine oxygen and moisture in the air into extremely fine particles, which are only one-thousandth of the diameter of vapor particles, so they cannot be seen by the naked eye. Daily exposure of hair to the air is prone to generate a lot of static electricity.
The price of negative ion hair dryers is generally more expensive than ordinary hair dryers. But it is not that the more expensive the better, we have to choose the hair dryer that suits us according to our own situation.
