News - Analysis of the market development status of the luggage manufacturing industry in 2020
Analysis of the market development status of the luggage manufacturing industry in 2020 News
According to data released by the China Leather Association, as of the end of 2018, there were 1,598 luggage companies in my country, with a cumulative sales income of 150.694 billion yuan, a year-on-year increase of 2.98%. In 2019, the sales revenue of luggage companies under the regulations was 141.905 billion yuan, a year-on-year decrease of 1.66%.
In sharp contrast, the development of the luggage industry in the vast central and western regions is seriously lagging behind. From the perspective of production areas, domestic production capacity is mainly concentrated in the three major luggage products gathering areas of Shiling in Guangdong Huadu, Pinghu in Zhejiang, and Baigou in Hebei; at the same time professional markets such as Haining Leather City, Shanghai Hongkou Leather Center, and Guangzhou Leather City were born.
