All roses They are undoubtedly one of the most popular plants in all the gardens of the world. Whether they are planted in soil or in pots, they need frequent waterings, especially during the summer during which they will have to be watered about 3-4 times a week depending on the climate and humidity.
In the case of tomato plants, it is essential to train them, since otherwise the stems are likely to break due to the weight of the tomatoes themselves. In addition, this way you will get to have a bigger plant that will give you a better production.
Because of this their water needs are very high, especially in summer during which it is highly recommended to put a plate or tray underneath that will have to be filled with water frequently. In hot, dry climates, watering should be daily.
